// Observability layer מעל orchestratorPolicyGate547 / deepHealthPolicy546.
//
// Endpoints:
//   V548-T01  GET  /api/v1/health/policy-log          (כל ה-log)
//   V548-T02  GET  /api/v1/health/policy-log/summary  (counts + trend)
